  "content": "<p>此地图<strong>不得</strong>重新上傳、修改，或納入其他 CurseForge 專案或合輯中。</p><p><strong>此世界是使用此模組包製作</strong>：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/slimies-custom-fnaf-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/slimies-custom-fnaf-experience</a>&nbsp;</p><p>這是我製作的第一張地圖，現已使用其他模組重新製作。辦公室置物櫃內有平板電腦、獎品櫃檯。海盜灣已移至用餐區左下角，現在有獨立的房間，內含餐桌和自己的後台。廚房旁新增了一間冷凍儲藏室。左側走廊盡頭現在是休息室。辦公室旁邊則有員工洗手間。</p><p>（此世界與朋友一起遊玩體驗更佳）</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">所需模組：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/management-wanted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Five Nights at Freddy's: Management Wanted | FNAF MW</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/management-wanted-more-decor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FNAF Management Wanted: More Decor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/surveillance-package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Surveillance Package</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-five-nights-at-freddys-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Five Nights at Freddy's | FNAF Mod</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chucklins-fnaf-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chucklin's FNaF Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fazcraft-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fazcraft [Minecraft x FNaF]</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-nightshift\" rel=\"nofollow\">FNAF - PROJECT: NIGHTSHIFT</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fnaf-animatronic-containment\" rel=\"nofollow\">FNAF: Animatronic Containment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-multiverse-of-freddys-fnaf\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Multiverse of Freddy's (FNaF)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/csfnaf\" rel=\"nofollow\">[CS] FNaF</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/csroleplaydecor\" rel=\"nofollow\">[CS] Roleplay Decor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/csfoundation\" rel=\"nofollow\">[CS] Foundation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cscurrency\" rel=\"nofollow\">[CS] Currency</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/csaugmentations\" rel=\"nofollow\">[CS] Augmentations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Portals (for Forge)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayFish's Furniture Mod: Refurbished</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfish-furniture-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayFish's Furniture Mod (Legacy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yuushya-townscape\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yuushya Townscape</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yuushya-modelling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yuushya Modelling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framedblocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">FramedBlocks</a></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">我的其他地圖：</span></p><p>FNAF 2：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-grand-reopening-fnaf-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-grand-reopening-fnaf-2</a></p><p>FNAF 3：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/fazbears-fright-fnaf-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/fazbears-fright-fnaf-3</a></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">FredBear's：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/fredbears-family-diner\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/fredbears-family-diner</a></span></p><p>Freddy's (1985)：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/freddy-fazbears-pizza-1985\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/freddy-fazbears-pizza-1985</a></p><p>FNAF Movie：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/freddy-fazbears-pizza-fnaf-movie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/freddy-fazbears-pizza-fnaf-movie</a></p><p>FNAF 6：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/labyrinth-fnaf-6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/labyrinth-fnaf-6</a></p>",
